# sleep.scn: Sleep between two ticks, shared by scenario_host and rt_test (pocketstation/tools/scenario.py).
# Author: suinevere
# Up is held from idle 3 across the sleep. During idle 4 Sleep is pressed and released, Down is pressed and
# released while asleep, and Sleep is pressed again to wake. No handler runs while asleep, each idle still takes
# one tick, Down is never seen, and Up reads as released until it is released and pressed again at idle 7.
enable 0x011F
tick 1
idle 2
press 0x10 3
idle 1
press 0x40 4
release 0x40 4
press 0x08 4
release 0x08 4
press 0x40 4
idle 1
release 0x40 5
idle 1
log_buttons
log_levels
release 0x10 6
idle 1
press 0x10 7
idle 1
log_buttons
idle 2
